# S2 anchored paths and tooling files.
#
# One named class, both halves of the pair. Naming only the .cls would ship an
# orphan -meta.xml, which is the behaviour tested on the Maximus branch.
classes/A0.cls
classes/A0.cls-meta.xml

# Tooling that lives inside the bundle. Dotfiles included.
**/.eslintrc.json
**/tsconfig.json
**/jest.config.js
**/__tests__/
